1
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:45,479
Wait,

2
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:47,439
you don't actually think I'm the killer, do you?

3
00:00:48,039 --> 00:00:49,280
Out of the four male players,

4
00:00:49,439 --> 00:00:50,280
aside from Lin Anzhe,

5
00:00:50,359 --> 00:00:50,799
Shi Meng,

6
00:00:51,079 --> 00:00:52,119
and the deceased He Shuyi,

7
00:00:52,719 --> 00:00:53,759
I'm the only one left.

8
00:00:54,479 --> 00:00:55,719
If you were really the killer,

9
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:57,439
then when the murder happened,

10
00:00:57,759 --> 00:00:58,759
was that a ghost standing beside me?

11
00:01:08,280 --> 00:01:09,319
I just received some info

12
00:01:09,439 --> 00:01:10,599
on Laila Escape Room.

13
00:01:11,760 --> 00:01:13,200
Sanshan Group's investment in the escape room...

14
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:13,920
The person in charge

15
00:01:13,959 --> 00:01:14,519
is Li Changyu.

16
00:01:18,040 --> 00:01:19,680
I already knew that.

17
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:21,359
I thought it was just a coincidence at the time.

18
00:01:22,120 --> 00:01:23,799
But after He Shuyi's murder,

19
00:01:23,799 --> 00:01:25,000
I now suspect both cases

20
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:26,640
are being manipulated by someone behind the scenes.

21
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:27,519
Remember?

22
00:01:28,079 --> 00:01:28,879
Li Changyu mentioned

23
00:01:29,400 --> 00:01:30,560
someone had instigated him to kill.

24
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:32,159
Never mind.

25
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:33,640
Tomorrow morning,

26
00:01:33,840 --> 00:01:34,640
we'll head to the detention center

27
00:01:34,840 --> 00:01:35,640
to interrogate Li Changyu.

28
00:01:36,719 --> 00:01:37,560
Then we'll go to the hospital

29
00:01:37,680 --> 00:01:38,640
to find Chen Xiaojing, the intern.

30
00:01:39,079 --> 00:01:39,439
All right.

31
00:01:39,719 --> 00:01:40,000
Okay.

32
00:01:40,359 --> 00:01:40,959
Let's go.

33
00:01:50,760 --> 00:01:51,640
How many months along are you?

34
00:01:55,840 --> 00:01:56,599
You don't need to hide it from me.

35
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:58,400
Back in the escape room,

36
00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:00,480
you kept subconsciously shielding your belly.

37
00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:01,480
I could tell right away.

38
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:02,719
Thank you.

39
00:02:04,120 --> 00:02:04,599
Don't worry.

40
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,000
We'll keep this a secret for you.

41
00:02:07,879 --> 00:02:08,879
Your classmates, teachers, and parents

42
00:02:09,319 --> 00:02:10,039
won't know a thing.

43
00:02:12,199 --> 00:02:13,000
Just over two months.

44
00:02:15,319 --> 00:02:16,639
It's Shuyi's child.

45
00:02:17,879 --> 00:02:18,599
Going forward,

46
00:02:19,599 --> 00:02:20,479
what do you plan to do?

47
00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:23,159
I don't know.

48
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:26,680
I really don't know what to do.

49
00:02:27,159 --> 00:02:28,439
Shuyi wanted me to get an abortion,

50
00:02:28,759 --> 00:02:29,840
but I refused.

51
00:02:30,919 --> 00:02:32,120
Why do you want this baby?

52
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:34,639
I already lost both of my parents.

53
00:02:35,719 --> 00:02:36,879
All I have left is my grandmother

54
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:38,280
and my younger sister.

55
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:40,319
When he was with me,

56
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:42,319
he promised

57
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:44,639
he'd marry me

58
00:02:45,879 --> 00:02:47,280
and give me a home.

59
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:50,560
He didn't want kids yet.

60
00:02:54,680 --> 00:02:56,599
He said it was too early for us.

61
00:03:00,439 --> 00:03:02,360
But now he's suddenly gone.

62
00:03:03,879 --> 00:03:05,400
He was an only child, too.

63
00:03:05,840 --> 00:03:07,560
What are his parents going to do?

64
00:03:10,639 --> 00:03:11,520
As far as I know,

65
00:03:12,080 --> 00:03:13,199
He Shuyi's family

66
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:14,639
arranged a marriage for him.

67
00:03:15,080 --> 00:03:16,520
The woman studied abroad

68
00:03:17,479 --> 00:03:18,560
and is a typical wealthy beauty.

69
00:03:19,759 --> 00:03:21,360
She could also help him launch his career.

70
00:03:22,879 --> 00:03:23,919
So from the very beginning,

71
00:03:25,439 --> 00:03:26,120
he never looked forward

72
00:03:26,120 --> 00:03:27,080
to having this child.

73
00:03:29,599 --> 00:03:30,520
Once you reach three months,

74
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:32,039
the pregnancy stabilizes.

75
00:03:32,439 --> 00:03:33,439
Having an abortion then

76
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:34,840
will take a heavy toll on your body.

77
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:37,680
You're still so young.

78
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:39,400
Don't let a moment of confusion

79
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:41,479
ruin your entire future.

80
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:43,960
Even though...

81
00:03:44,199 --> 00:03:44,759
before he died,

82
00:03:44,759 --> 00:03:45,800
we had a fight,

83
00:03:46,639 --> 00:03:47,520
and his parents

84
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:48,719
arranged a marriage for him...

85
00:03:49,719 --> 00:03:51,520
I still love him.

86
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:54,000
I can't let him go.

87
00:03:54,759 --> 00:03:55,520
Do you want to know

88
00:03:56,719 --> 00:03:57,719
who the real killer is?

89
00:03:57,960 --> 00:03:58,360
Yes.

90
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:13,400
How is that possible?

91
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:15,599
How could that be?

92
00:04:25,160 --> 00:04:26,399
Tomorrow morning, we're scheduled

93
00:04:26,399 --> 00:04:27,639
to see Li Changyu at the detention center

94
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:29,600
to ask about the escape room investment.

95
00:04:30,439 --> 00:04:33,480
At 2:00 PM, we'll head to the station

96
00:04:34,079 --> 00:04:35,639
to interrogate Lin Anzhe and Xu Xiaoya.

97
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:36,480
Right.

98
00:04:37,519 --> 00:04:38,839
As for Zhang Dafeng at the psychiatric hospital,

99
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:39,759
remember to check with Lu Yuan

100
00:04:39,759 --> 00:04:40,519
and arrange a time with them.

101
00:04:41,519 --> 00:04:42,120
Yeah.

102
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:44,920
We already know

103
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:46,279
the actual killer in the escape room case.

104
00:04:47,319 --> 00:04:48,680
What we need to find out now is

105
00:04:49,160 --> 00:04:51,920
what exactly happened to He Shuyi before he died.

106
00:04:55,759 --> 00:04:56,600
Xu Xiaoya...

107
00:04:57,639 --> 00:04:59,360
She must have left out some crucial detail

108
00:04:59,399 --> 00:05:00,480
that she kept from the police.

109
00:05:01,040 --> 00:05:02,319
That's the main focus of tomorrow's interrogation.

110
00:05:03,439 --> 00:05:03,759
Mm-hmm.

111
00:05:04,519 --> 00:05:05,319
Setting that aside, though,

112
00:05:07,319 --> 00:05:09,319
is Lin Anzhe really an accomplice?

113
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:12,480
The poisoning definitely happened before the game.

114
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:15,759
To enter the crime scene before the game,

115
00:05:16,439 --> 00:05:17,879
it must have been an inside job.

116
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:20,120
Even if it was him,

117
00:05:20,759 --> 00:05:22,240
do you think he'd tell the police voluntarily?

118
00:05:22,759 --> 00:05:24,000
Unless the killer rats him out.

119
00:05:25,839 --> 00:05:27,279
You'd better think carefully about

120
00:05:27,399 --> 00:05:28,639
how to get a man facing certain death

121
00:05:28,639 --> 00:05:29,759
like Li Changyu to open up

122
00:05:29,759 --> 00:05:30,720
and cooperate with your investigation.

123
00:05:42,759 --> 00:05:44,000
Do you recognize this coin,

124
00:05:49,360 --> 00:05:50,000
Li Changyu?

125
00:05:50,360 --> 00:05:50,959
Answer me.

126
00:05:54,639 --> 00:05:56,639
I'm getting the death penalty anyway.

127
00:05:56,639 --> 00:05:57,680
Why bother asking me this?

128
00:05:58,160 --> 00:05:58,879
What,

129
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:00,879
talking will reduce my sentence?

130
00:06:01,519 --> 00:06:02,560
I heard your parents

131
00:06:02,720 --> 00:06:04,079
came all the way from the country to see you,

132
00:06:04,839 --> 00:06:05,800
yet you refused their visit.

133
00:06:06,839 --> 00:06:08,240
They poured everything they had

134
00:06:08,360 --> 00:06:10,439
into raising their son,

135
00:06:11,319 --> 00:06:12,480
only for him to abandon them

136
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:14,040
after killing his wife and child,

137
00:06:14,199 --> 00:06:15,600
turning into a monstrous killer.

138
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:16,680
What do you want?

139
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:19,319
We've decided to give you special treatment,

140
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:20,800
letting you and your parents

141
00:06:20,839 --> 00:06:22,199
reunite in a private room

142
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:24,040
to catch up properly.

143
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:29,199
So what if they raised me?

144
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:31,439
They just wanted me to rescue them

145
00:06:31,439 --> 00:06:32,399
from their poverty.

146
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:35,519
Spouting nonsense all day long!

147
00:06:36,920 --> 00:06:39,639
Now that I'm a killer, they want to see me?

148
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:40,639
Isn't it just because

149
00:06:41,079 --> 00:06:42,399
their sweet dream shattered?

150
00:06:43,279 --> 00:06:44,199
Let me tell you,

151
00:06:45,319 --> 00:06:47,279
even until the day I die,

152
00:06:47,279 --> 00:06:47,959
I'll never see them!

153
00:06:51,279 --> 00:06:52,279
Do you recognize it now?

154
00:06:56,279 --> 00:06:57,079
I do.

155
00:06:58,079 --> 00:06:59,480
It's a project I invested in,

156
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:00,639
Laila Escape Room.

157
00:07:00,879 --> 00:07:01,959
The gold coins were souvenir prizes.

158
00:07:04,439 --> 00:07:05,759
What does the pattern on it represent?

159
00:07:06,279 --> 00:07:07,879
How did you come up with the design?

160
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:10,199
I don't know what it means.

161
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:11,879
A partner of mine provided it.

162
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:13,399
Who was that person?

163
00:07:25,199 --> 00:07:26,399
Did you get anything out of Li Changyu?

164
00:07:31,120 --> 00:07:31,920
Cruz.

165
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:33,439
Probably not his real name.

166
00:07:34,639 --> 00:07:35,560
I've never met him in person.

167
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:37,920
All our communication was online.

168
00:07:38,519 --> 00:07:39,439
His bank account was also overseas.

169
00:07:39,439 --> 00:07:40,079
His bank account was also overseas.

170
00:07:41,959 --> 00:07:42,920
You were threatened?

171
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:46,879
I embezzled company funds,

172
00:07:46,879 --> 00:07:48,600
and he found out about it.

173
00:07:49,519 --> 00:07:50,839
He threatened me with the evidence,

174
00:07:50,959 --> 00:07:52,199
forcing me to approve the investment

175
00:07:52,199 --> 00:07:53,360
for Laila Escape Room.

176
00:07:55,279 --> 00:07:56,399
Can you still contact him?

177
00:07:58,639 --> 00:08:00,160
He's always the one who reaches out.

178
00:08:00,759 --> 00:08:03,199
Otherwise, he just vanishes without a trace.

179
00:08:04,399 --> 00:08:06,000
It's a different account every time.

180
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:08,879
You said someone urged you to kill your wife and child

181
00:08:09,279 --> 00:08:10,439
to eliminate obstacles. Was that him?

182
00:08:12,319 --> 00:08:13,199
It was him.

183
00:08:14,519 --> 00:08:16,199
Everything started when he showed up.

184
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:18,120
From then on, there was no turning back.

185
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:27,120
This Cruz...

186
00:08:27,879 --> 00:08:28,879
...blackmailed Li Changyu,

187
00:08:29,759 --> 00:08:30,920
forced him to invest in the escape room,

188
00:08:31,360 --> 00:08:32,639
and manipulated him into killing his wife.

189
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:33,799
And the escape room case...

190
00:08:34,399 --> 00:08:35,519
...happened right inside

191
00:08:35,720 --> 00:08:36,919
the escape room Li Changyu invested in.

192
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:39,159
It's all connected.

193
00:08:40,200 --> 00:08:41,720
As the investment head

194
00:08:41,720 --> 00:08:42,720
of Laila Escape Room, Li Changyu...

195
00:08:43,559 --> 00:08:45,080
if he gets the death penalty,

196
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:47,879
dead men tell no tales.

197
00:08:48,519 --> 00:08:49,480
Meanwhile, Cruz...

198
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:51,480
only manipulated people,

199
00:08:51,919 --> 00:08:53,120
instigating a crime.

200
00:08:57,480 --> 00:08:58,679
You got summoned too?

201
00:08:59,120 --> 00:09:00,159
Seriously?

202
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:01,519
What are the police thinking?

203
00:09:02,159 --> 00:09:04,120
Could a disabled person like you kill someone,

204
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:06,840
or could a female college student like me?

205
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:10,039
In a moment, you two

206
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:11,840
must cooperate with Expert Gu's questioning.

207
00:09:12,440 --> 00:09:13,679
You can only go home once you're cleared.

208
00:09:14,559 --> 00:09:16,279
What expert?

209
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:18,200
Her?

210
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:19,399
Gu Yan.

211
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:20,679
She's our police department's special

212
00:09:20,679 --> 00:09:21,759
Criminal Psychology Expert.

213
00:09:25,559 --> 00:09:26,559
Officer Lu said

214
00:09:27,399 --> 00:09:29,120
she's the expert specially assigned to interrogate you.

215
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:33,559
She wouldn't abuse power for personal vendetta, right?

216
00:09:34,159 --> 00:09:34,919
Xu Xiaoya.

217
00:09:35,399 --> 00:09:36,320
Don't overthink it.

218
00:09:36,440 --> 00:09:37,600
I'm just asking you a few questions.

219
00:09:38,320 --> 00:09:39,759
I really didn't kill that idio—

220
00:09:41,759 --> 00:09:42,519
He Shuyi.

221
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:45,559
Inside the room, there were four beds.

222
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:48,080
There was a mannequin on the left bed,

223
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:50,159
so I picked one on the right.

224
00:09:50,480 --> 00:09:51,279
I pulled back the sheet

225
00:09:51,279 --> 00:09:52,320
and lay down.

226
00:09:53,360 --> 00:09:54,240
Then later on,

227
00:09:54,960 --> 00:09:56,039
He Shuyi walked inside.

228
00:10:11,080 --> 00:10:11,840
Think carefully.

229
00:10:12,440 --> 00:10:13,799
Don't miss a single detail.

230
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:15,720
Every single move,

231
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:17,799
tell me in detail.

232
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:20,360
When I pulled back the sheet,

233
00:10:20,919 --> 00:10:22,519
I think I smelled

234
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:24,240
a faint odor.

235
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:25,919
It was slightly bitter.

236
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:29,000
I couldn't stand it,

237
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:31,000
so I swapped beds with the one next to me.
